  "summary": "This single-page English circular, issued by the Swatantra Party Ad-hoc Committee in Madras on 7 May 1983, announces an effort by former active workers to revive the party. It invites recipients to a meeting at Moorthi Kalai Arangam (Municipal Hall), Kumbakonam, on Sunday, 15 May 1983, at 9 a.m., where a committee is to be elected.\n\nThe notice presents the revival as an attempt to restore the party founded by C. Rajagopalachari (Rajaji) and Minoo Masani. It lists the Reception Committee and Ad-hoc Committee conveners, and provides A. G. Srinivasan's Kumbakonam address as the local contact. The handwritten envelope address identifies M. R. Masani as the recipient of this copy.",
